  "blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "数学归纳法证明由两部分组成：第一部分，证明（验证）",
        "命题$A(1)$成立；第二部分，假设命题$A(n)$对于$n=k$正确，并",
        "证明$A(n)$对于$n=k+1$正确，即证明$A(k)\\Longrightarrow A(k+1)$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "如果两部分都证明完毕，那么根据数学归纳法原理，命题",
        "$A(n)$对于$n$取任意自然数都成立."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "现在我们可以确认：等式（1）对于$n$取任意自然数都成",
        "立，因为$n=1$时它成立，而且由$A(k)$可以得出$A(k+1)$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "例1. 对于$n$取任意自然数值，计算和"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$\\frac{1}{1\\times3}+\\frac{1}{3\\times5}+\\frac{1}{5\\times7}+\\cdots+\\frac{1}{(2n-1)(2n+1)}$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "用$S_n$表示这个和. 为了推测$S_n$具有怎样的公式，先计",
        "算这个和的前几个值：$S_1,S_2,S_3,S_4,\\cdots$. 研究这些数后，提",
        "出假设，然后用数学归纳法对它加以证明."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$S_1=\\frac{1}{1\\times3}=\\frac{1}{3}$；"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$S_2=\\frac{1}{1\\times3}+\\frac{1}{3\\times5}=S_1+\\frac{1}{3\\times5}=\\frac{1}{3}+\\frac{1}{3\\times5}=\\frac{2}{5}$；"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$S_3=\\frac{1}{1\\times3}+\\frac{1}{3\\times5}+\\frac{1}{5\\times7}=S_2+\\frac{1}{5\\times7}↵=\\frac{2}{5}+\\frac{1}{5\\times7}=\\frac{3}{7}$；"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$S_4=\\frac{1}{1\\times3}+\\frac{1}{3\\times5}+\\frac{1}{5\\times7}+\\frac{1}{7\\times9}=S_3+\\frac{1}{7\\times9}↵=\\frac{3}{7}+\\frac{1}{7\\times9}=\\frac{4}{9}$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "研究这些和之后，我们发现，它们的分子就是所要求的和",
        "的序号，分母就是最后一个加数的分母的第二个因数."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "foot",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "· 6 ·"
      ]
    }
  ]
